      "updated_at": "2019-11-19T11:00:37Z",
      "body": "I've done little work:\r\n`npm install core-js` to include some dependencies like Map, Symbol and Array.functions.\r\n\r\nIn klaro.js (main src file) add:\r\n```\r\nimport 'core-js/es/array';\r\nimport 'core-js/es/map';\r\nimport 'core-js/es/symbol';\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis works for me on IE11 tested with Win10 Pro 64.\r\nBut not for IE10 and IE9. These browsers need polyfills for Promise, window.boat, document.currentScript, object functions and Set.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
