      "updated_at": "2019-11-20T20:43:13Z",
      "body": "I've a solution for older browsers:\r\n`script.dataset` won't work on older browser. I've replaced with `script.getAttribute(\"data-name-of-attr\")` and `script.setAttribute(\"data-name-of-attr\", theValue)` in main file `klaro.js` and `consent-manger.js`. Some other minor changes have to be done too. I will fork klaro and put my changes on a separate branch soon as posible.\r\nMy modification works down to IE9.",
